      "cooked": "<p>When an Asset is created through <strong>Asset Capitalization → Create New Composite Asset</strong>, the system allows successful submission and asset creation. However, while attempting to <strong>Split Asset</strong>, the system throws an error stating:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>“Please capitalize this asset before submitting.”</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This happens even though the asset was already created via Asset Capitalization.</p>\n<p>I did not get this error earlier. I encountered this error a few days ago.</p>",
